{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 53131, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 41175, "uid": 92835, "type": 4, "title": "raid的图文讲解", "tag": "0", "created_at": 1599416471, "updated_at": 1686720682, "updated_uid": 92835, "comment_at": 1694160379, "last_at": 1694160379, "comment_count": 529, "status": 1, "summary": "2023年6月22改版取消1~29级车，现在只有30级车，偶尔会出现“史莱姆王”和“隐藏Boss”。“隐藏Boss”拥有更多的血量和属性，奖励也更丰厚，具体信息等待详细更新。关于Raid如果本篇攻略出", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/10/704002.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1599416373950_25590691.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1600615417223_75395707.jpg", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 62, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 204370, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 0, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 61, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 53131, "content": "<div id=\"false\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">2023年6月22改版</span></p></div><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">取消1~29级车，现在只有30级车，偶尔会出现“史莱姆王”和“隐藏Boss”。“隐藏Boss”拥有更多的血量和属性，奖励也更丰厚，具体信息等待详细更新。</span></span></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">关于 Raid</span></div></div></span><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"font-style: italic;\">如果本篇攻略出现了错误的地方请立即指出，不然被骂还是小事，主要是容易误导萌新就不好搞了，那么下面开始讲解请听我慢慢道来</span></div><div id=\"false\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div id=\"false\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div id=\"false\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div id=\"false\">raid BOSS在这里通称为&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">车</span></span>（1-29 为婴儿车）</div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div>参与、杀死 不同等级的boss奖励不一样（伤害排名越高，出箱子的概率越高，第一名30%）</div><div>1-10&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">铜箱子</span></div><div>11-20&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">银箱子</span></div><div>21-29&nbsp; 金箱子</div><div>30&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;白金箱子（五星出货率 13%，12%五星票，1%五星升星史莱姆 ）</div><div>（<span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">杀手池开启后，打杀手池里的1-29级车，获取白金箱子的概率和30级一样</span>）</div></span><div></div></span><div></div></span><div></div><div><br></div><div id=\"false\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">如何发车</span></div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 176, 80);\"></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">如何召唤 Raid（发车）：</span>在Raid活动期间，进行会耗费体力的副本时，有概率会出现“降临”，这就是告诉你BOSS已经刷出来了。</div><div>（raid期间的剧情副本也可以出raid boss，<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">耗费体力越高的副本boss出现的概率越大，花费200体力必出车</span>）</div></span><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">Raid 的等级机制：</span>车从开始都是一级，出车后，参与击杀（参与必须造成的伤害大于1%，否则车不会升级），车死后，下一辆车等级会+1，30级为满级。</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206);\">杀手助战</span>：召唤杀手打车的前提是你最少要打一下才能召唤，造成的伤害必须大于1%，不然没奖励也不会升级车</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/10/704002.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/10/704002.jpg\" style=\"width: 456px; height: 1013px;\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2400\"></div><br></span></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"true\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">我可以打哪些车</span></span></span></div></div><br></div><div>在杀手模式没到之前只能打好友的车，<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;\">尽可能不要去打别人未到30级的车除非好友点了请求支援，不然千万不要随便去打别人未满30级的车，不然别人花体力刷出来用来升级的车被你打了别人要重新刷（但现在有婴儿车保护机制，车主没打过的婴儿车应该不会刷到了，非要打的话检查一下车上有没有人，没有人千万别打，有人可以打）</span>（PS：一定不要随便打大佬30级前的车不然大佬脾气不好直接给你删了）<section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\" id=\"false\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1599414979428_18617589.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" data-width=\"54\" data-height=\"54\"></section></div><div><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><br></section></div><div id=\"false\">不能一票秒的时候<span style=\"color: rgb(177, 56, 206); font-weight: bold;\">只打残血车或者上车人数大于2的车</span>，不然没有打死车，残血车没人收会导致&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 20px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">灵车。</span>可能被删好友。（因为大佬都是脚本打车，脚本不打残血车，所以你把别人的车打残血了就会导致这个车不会有其他人打了，只能等待两个小时自动结束，等于浪费别人两个小时时间并且浪费别人一个车，灵别人的车是RD最严重的过错没有之一）</div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">杀手模式</span></div></div><br></div><div>杀手模式一般会在raid开启的2天后开放（周六凌晨3点），在你参与、击杀这一期你自己的第一个30级Raid车后，在双倍Raid加成按钮上面会有一个SR标志可以点进去看到非好友的其他玩家的车并且攻击（杀手模式里打别人的车也会消耗自己的raid攻击票）这些并不重要，重要的是开启了杀手模式后每天打车20次（好友车也算在这20次之内，只要伤害大于1%即可）会获得<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">四个固定的白金箱子</span>（实属萌新的救星，属于Raid低保）<section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1599416431292_91865781.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"height: 90px; width: 90px;\" data-width=\"198\" data-height=\"198\"></section></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"true\"></div><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div id=\"true\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">问答</span></div></div><br></div><div id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">什么情况下值得买票：可以稳定一票打死即可放心大胆买票，能打超过1%但是不能一票打死也可以买，但是不赚，低于1%老老实实发车吧，买票就是亏。</span></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"true\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">如果没有针对这期BOSS的攻击卡该怎么办：</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">发车。</span></span></div></span><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">自己的好友不行总是没有办法打死我的车该怎么办：</span></span>这时候就需要自己攻击一次车后，按旁边的SR按键将自己的车扔进杀手池里让非好友玩家进行攻击了（长时间不登陆和摆烂好友不能留）&nbsp;<img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1599416373950_25590691.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"height: 140.99px; width: 133.673px;\" data-width=\"603\" data-height=\"636\"></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">我的车30级了能给别人打了吗：</span></span>可以，除了第一次出30级车需要自己打1％其他后续出现的30级车就全交给好友打，自己可以完全不碰，出箱子的概率和伤害第一名一样，如果好友拉胯了建议自己打一下之后放入杀手池，总之尽量30级过后能不碰自己的车绝对不碰，反正只要boss死了车主出箱子的几率和第一名一样高<section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1599416348066_41839183.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" data-width=\"198\" data-height=\"148\"></section></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">30级的箱子出现概率怎么那么小：</span>箱子的出现概率是由别人和你一起攻击这辆车的伤害数量来进行排名的，一辆车的排名越高出现箱子的概率也就越高（自己的车默认出现箱子的概率和第一名一样，如果这期自己的实力有限无法打掉30级boss 1％的血量的话可以让自己这一期成为一个专门发车的玩家）<section class=\"\" style=\"color: inherit; font-size: inherit; font-style: inherit; display: inline-block; position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1599416185191_35425040.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" data-width=\"198\" data-height=\"153\"></section></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">如何知道自己出的五星票的数量是非还是欧：（<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;font-weight:700;\">打车数+发车数</span>）*0.3*0.12=正常概率出票数</span></span></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div><span style=\"font-size: 20px; font-weight: bold;\">杀死30级的BOSS掉落的箱子能开出什么：</span>角色：最低四星角色券或者五星角色券、点火石材料：1到5粒不等、5星装备券、温泉皮肤、本期的raid皮肤、raid币数量大概是一万，血石1-10不等（如果还有其他没说的欢迎补充）<section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1599416199785_26546540.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"height: 180.252px; width: 177.997px;\" data-width=\"237\" data-height=\"240\"></section></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">raid商店</span></span></div></div><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">对于raid商店建议把上面的红线框住的东西优先换掉，后面的第五个是你换完前面四个就会白给你的东西，raid商店上面换完了就刷新，2700钻石刷新真的不亏，如果要把raid商店刷新完一共需要3次2700一共是7100钻石，加上raid期间可能要抽的对策至少要预留50000以上的钻石作为保险</span></div><div id=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></div><div id=\"false\"><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block; position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1600615417223_75395707.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"width: 456px; height: 987px;\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\"></section><br></div><div id=\"false\"><span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"mask-point2\" style=\"margin-left: -3px; display: block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: absolute; top: -3px; left: 207.188px; cursor: n-resize;\"></span><span contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"mask-point3\" style=\"display: block; width: 6px; height: 6px; background: rgb(0, 0, 0); position: absolute; top: -3px; right: -3px; cursor: ne-resize;\"></span></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"false\">raid副本</div><div id=\"false\"><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1600615460169_71933551.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"height: 987.98px; width: 455.983px;\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\"></section></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"false\">raid任务：</div><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1600615487776_62693691.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"height: 987px; width: 456px;\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\"></section><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\" id=\"false\"><div><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><br></section></div>raid界面的功能</section><div><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/10/777844.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/10/777844.jpg\" style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem; width: 456px; height: 1013px;\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2400\"><br></div><div><br><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"false\">进入车里的界面：</div><div id=\"false\"><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1599415649549_59690938.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"height: 988px; width: 456px;\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\"></section></div><div id=\"false\"><br></div><div id=\"true\"><br></div><div id=\"true\">RB模式：</div><div id=\"true\"><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1612367952926_42705527.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"height: 988px; width: 456px;\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\"></section></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\">RB票：每次RIAD打一车都会加一点积攒条，攒满20可获得一张RB票</div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\">boss技能：层数越高boss技能伤害就会越高，并且血量和防御力都会上升</div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\">加成援助：一般援助效果由角色和灵魂宪章的练度而增加，角色练度只吃加值和点火，灵魂宪章只吃加值</div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\">最终爆裂：打完boss后加成援助的列表里出现的파이널 버스트后的百分比相加后追加额外的百分比伤害，比如我打了1000w最终爆裂有40％就会在打完后追加400w伤害（头像黑白的就是你没这角色，那个buff也就没有）</div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\"><br></div><div class=\"last-min-wrapper\" style=\"min-height:1px\" id=\"true\"><section class=\"\" style=\"display: inline-block;position: relative;\" id=\"true\"><img src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1612368446665_92747521.jpg\" alt=\"raid的图文讲解\" data-upload=\"true\" style=\"height: 988px; width: 456px;\" data-width=\"1080\" data-height=\"2340\"></section></div></div>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/107851/2022/3/10/704002.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1599416373950_25590691.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1600615417223_75395707.jpg"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 92835, "username": "海洋饼干", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/5.png", "description": "两岸猿声啼不住，轻舟已过万重山", "follow_num": 859, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "海洋超人", "tag_color": "#FF0000"}, "role_id": 2, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 97969791, "content_num": 160, "read_num": 4509513, "like_num": 2354}, "update_user": {"uid": 92835, "username": "海洋饼干", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/5.png", "description": "两岸猿声啼不住，轻舟已过万重山", "follow_num": 859, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1069, "name": "天命之子韩服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1603255687217_81752678.webp?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_250,w_250", "alias": "destinychild", "content_count": 6962, "follow_count": 16729}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 92835, "username": "海洋饼干", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/5.png", "last_ip_area": "安徽省", "last_login_device_num": 1}, {"uid": 107851, "username"